  "keywords": ["astrobiology", "abiotic computation", "physical reservoir computing", "agency", "planetary intelligence", "SETI", "Bayesian identifiability"],
  "abstract": "This theoretical preprint asks whether biological evolution is a necessary intermediate in intelligence's emergence. It distinguishes capability from causal origin and proves a conditional non-identifiability result for functional observations when direct-emergence and constructed-origin hypotheses induce equal likelihoods.",
